<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to weak. Demand was light. Top $48.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 47.50-48.50</p>
<p>Sows - unevenly steady. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.  39.00-44.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs.  44.00-46.50</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs.  46.00-49.00</p>
<p>		few over 600 lbs.  49.00-51.00</p>
</text>
